{
  "hero_headline": "霍尔木兹海峡局势紧张加剧，全球金融市场避险情绪升温 / Hormuz Strait Tensions Escalate, Fueling Global Market Risk Aversion",
  "daily_overview": "今日全球焦点集中在三个领域：时政方面，霍尔木兹海峡紧张局势持续升级，伊朗表态已为战争做好全面准备，导致全球能源供应不确定性增加。财经领域，受地区冲突及利率预期波动影响，黄金价格波动，多国开始重塑工业战略以保障供应链安全。科技领域，AI模型能力持续演进，开源生态与端到端计算成为新趋势，但AI代理系统的安全性与“作弊”倾向引发了行业监管层面的广泛讨论。\n\nToday's global focus spans three key pillars: In politics, escalating tensions in the Strait of Hormuz, with Iran declaring full readiness for war, have stoked uncertainty in global energy supplies. Finance-wise, the conflict and shifting interest rate expectations have impacted gold prices, prompting nations to pivot toward industrial strategies aimed at supply chain resilience. On the tech front, AI models continue to evolve with strong momentum in open-source ecosystems and edge computing, while the safety and inherent “cheating” tendencies of AI agents have ignited critical debates regarding industry regulation.",
